- What about me?

19:30.908 --> 19:33.399
You kissed first. Why'd you do that?

19:33.678 --> 19:35.908
Oh, I was plowed.

19:36.681 --> 19:37.705
Really?

19:38.082 --> 19:39.447
Oh, come on, you moron.

19:39.617 --> 19:43.986
I'm sitting in the middle of your bed
in my sexiest lingerie.

19:45.323 --> 19:48.690
